# Flags for `verilator --lint-only` (one or more per line; # starts a comment).
# Warnings are never fatal here: rules.toml decides which codes are errors.
--lint-only
-Wall
-Wno-fatal
--language 1800-2017
--error-limit 200
# Every design file is linted in one invocation, so several top modules are expected.
-Wno-MULTITOP
# Module name == file name is enforced by Verible (module-filename); avoid a duplicate finding.
-Wno-DECLFILENAME
